"受任","evidence":["wanglou-q-52d65d2e16edfb68507e"]},{"person":"luxun-p0069","role":"受任","evidence":["wanglou-q-52d65d2e16edfb68507e"]},{"person":"panlu-p0023","role":"受任","evidence":["wanglou-q-52d65d2e16edfb68507e"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0062","role":"受任","evidence":["wanglou-q-52d65d2e16edfb68507e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wanglou-q-52d65d2e16edfb68507e"]},"ordering_evidence":"wanglou-q-52d65d2e16edfb68507e","order":11077}],"persons":[{"id":"luxun-p0069","name":"王蕃","evidence":["luxun-q-o076","wanglou-q-f8f44ded1581f439e9d8","wanglou-q-c23c889454159c94bf24","wanglou-q-cbb66fc8866c3370c44f","wanglou-q-4117c64989d331cbfbf1","wanglou-q-d663be06ae8e54380fe2","wanglou-q-417b48a6aa9be081f5ed","wanglou-q-9d5abb6165d196b3ff71","wanglou-q-52d65d2e16edfb68507e","wanglou-q-ccce8d3f0a7a001adfaa","wanglou-q-6c2a8dea17da3c4737b4","wanglou-q-7edcd423890e0a3377e4","wanglou-q-469dbb058c9df3da3b77","wanglou-q-ccf1d82615dbb9718f39","wanglou-q-e3f0ae338474432bfe7b","wanglou-q-69e5e1cb3dd36b06e6ae","wanglou-q-f8499969f36a9bc0617d","wanglou-q-8a17b55711e85139cf4f","yululu-q-57f757984493adb40016","yululu-q-516a6deca6b34859bb81"],"facts":[{"id":"wanglou-f-e80ee0a925fbc3ece6b0","text":"字永元","evidence":["wanglou-q-f8f44ded1581f439e9d8"]},{"id":"wanglou-f-10c3ecca94356aa6def4","text":"庐江人","evidence":["wanglou-q-f8f44ded1581f439e9d8"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"luxun-m-o076-luxun-p0069","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-o076"]},{"id":"wanglou-m-2280bf30d886584f5f5b","kind":"mention","text":"裴松之按《吴录》王蕃嘲万彧时序乖互","evidence":["wanglou-q-469dbb058c9df3da3b77"]},{"id":"wanglou-m-3b96e10f735f53667bf3","kind":"mention","text":"陈寿录薛莹、胡冲评王蕃楼玄贺邵韦曜华覈，并论数子遭际","evidence":["wanglou-q-ccf1d82615dbb9718f39"]},{"id":"wanglou-m-d20917131d2f048371f6","kind":"mention","text":"裴注指出《江表传》王蕃被杀缘由与本传不同","evidence":["wanglou-q-e3f0ae338474432bfe7b"]},{"id":"wanglou-m-451a49d8e9e3aa6f70b7","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：字永元，庐江人；博览多闻，兼通术艺","evidence":["wanglou-q-69e5e1cb3dd36b06e6ae"]},{"id":"wanglou-m-586e027d7c43efb4cd3a","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：体气高亮，不能承颜顺指；时或忤意，积以见责","evidence":["wanglou-q-f8499969f36a9bc0617d"]},{"id":"wanglou-m-ec7c6152db69dc7852e6","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：死时年三十九","evidence":["wanglou-q-8a17b55711e85139cf4f"]},{"id":"yululu-m-49212732b800e9472db6","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及王蕃，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-516a6deca6b34859bb81"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-q-o076","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-11441c73cfeb9b85407b","layer":"original","quote":"闻武昌左部督薛莹，征下狱〖1〗，抗上疏曰：“夫俊乂者〖2〗，国家之良宝，社稷之贵资；庶政所以伦叙〖3〗，四门所以穆清也〖4〗。故大司农楼玄、散骑中常侍王蕃、少府李勖〖5〗，皆当世秀颖，一时显器；既蒙初宠，从容列位〖6〗；而并旋受诛殛，或圮族替祀〖7〗，或投弃荒裔。盖《周礼》有赦贤之辟〖8〗，《春秋》有宥善之义〖9〗。《书》曰：‘与其杀不辜〖10〗，宁失不经〖11〗。’而蕃等罪名未定，大辟已加〖12〗；心经忠义，身被极刑：岂不痛哉！且已死之刑〖13〗，固无所识〖14〗；至乃焚烁流漂，弃之水滨：惧非先王之正典，或甫侯之所戒也〖15〗。是以百姓哀耸，士民同戚。蕃、勖永已，悔亦靡及〖16〗；诚望陛下，赦召玄出。而顷闻薛莹，猝见逮录〖17〗。莹父综，纳言先帝〖18〗，傅弼文皇〖19〗。及莹承基，内厉名行；今之所坐〖20〗，罪在可宥。臣惧有司，未详其事；如复诛戮，益失民望。乞垂天恩，原赦莹罪；哀矜庶狱〖21〗，清澄刑网〖22〗。则天下幸甚！”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":378,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":421,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-341827cec2f744f90610","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-ebdb94c9270d31300148","layer":"original","quote":"贺邵字兴伯，会稽山阴人也〖1〗。﹝一﹞孙休即位，从中郎为散骑中常侍〖2〗。出为吴郡太守。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-4117c64989d331cbfbf1","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-8fe95262eaec65905a52","layer":"original","quote":"又中书丞陈声，皓之嬖臣〖10〗，数谮毁蕃","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-417b48a6aa9be081f5ed","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-cffc22fe3a057ac384ff","layer":"original","quote":"甘露二年，丁忠使晋还，皓大会群臣。蕃沉醉顿伏〖12〗，皓疑而不悦，舆蕃出外〖13〗。顷之请还，酒亦不解；蕃性有威严，行止自若〖14〗。皓大怒，呵左右于殿下斩之。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-469dbb058c9df3da3b77","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-5e574a309008fdcd5dc4","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：本传云丁忠使晋还，皓为大会，于会中杀蕃。检忠从北还，在此年之春；彧时尚未为丞相，至秋乃为相耳。《吴录》所言，为乖互不同。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cde2697c79ac56416fb3","start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-52d65d2e16edfb68507e","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-3a9b33fc8ece7eee5aaa","layer":"original","quote":"孙皓即位，与王蕃、郭逴、万彧俱为散骑中常侍。出为会稽太守。入为大司农。旧禁中主者，自用亲近人作之〖3〗。彧陈亲密近识，宜用好人；皓因敕有司〖4〗：求忠清之士，以应其选。遂用玄为宫下镇，禁中候〖5〗，主殿中事。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":104,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-69e5e1cb3dd36b06e6ae","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-542633ed464867e4cacb","layer":"original","quote":"王蕃字永元，庐江人也〖1〗。博览多闻。兼通术艺","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-6c2a8dea17da3c4737b4","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-b129761fce3317a2290a","layer":"pei","quote":"出登（来）〔袁〕山，使亲近将，跳蕃首，作虎跳狼争咋啮之，头皆碎坏；欲以示威，使众不敢犯也","attribution":"裴注·《江表传》","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cde2697c79ac56416fb3","start":89,"end":133,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-7edcd423890e0a3377e4","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-8eb1e6186b39a112b4ba","layer":"pei","quote":"《吴录》曰：“皓每于会，因酒酣，辄令侍臣嘲谑公卿，以为笑乐。万彧既为（左）〔右〕丞相，蕃嘲彧曰：‘鱼潜于渊，出水煦沫。何则？物有本性，不可横处非分也！彧出自溪谷，羊质虎皮；虚受光赫之宠，跨越三九之位。犬马犹能识养，将何以报厚施乎？’彧曰：‘唐虞之朝无谬举之才，造父之门无驽蹇之质；蕃上诬明选，下讪桢干：何伤于日月？适（多）见其不知量耳！’”","attribution":"《吴录》","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cde2697c79ac56416fb3","start":0,"end":170,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-8a17b55711e85139cf4f","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-e4d290f864fe94e92836","layer":"original","quote":"蕃死时年三十九","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":6,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":7,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-9d5abb6165d196b3ff71","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-e774f8c8af898e42f886","layer":"original","quote":"卫将军滕牧、征西将军留平请〖15〗，不能得。﹝一﹞丞相陆凯上疏曰〖16〗：“常侍王蕃，黄中通理〖17〗，知天知物，处朝忠謇〖18〗。斯社稷之重镇，大吴之龙逢也〖19〗。昔事景皇〖20〗，纳言左右〖21〗；景皇钦嘉，叹为异伦〖22〗。而陛下忿其苦辞〖23〗，恶其直对；枭之殿堂，尸骸暴弃；（郡）〔邦〕内伤心，有识悲悼！”其痛蕃如此。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":165,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-c23c889454159c94bf24","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-509f07a12985aedad2c9","layer":"original","quote":"孙休即位，与贺邵、薛莹、虞汜俱为散骑中常侍〖4〗；皆加驸马都尉〖5〗，时论清之〖6〗。遣使至蜀，蜀人称焉。还，为夏口监军〖7〗。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-cbb66fc8866c3370c44f","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-8fe95262eaec65905a52","layer":"original","quote":"孙皓初，复入为常侍。与万彧同官，彧与皓有旧；俗士挟侵〖8〗，谓蕃自轻〖9〗。又中书丞陈声，皓之嬖臣〖10〗，数谮毁蕃。蕃体气高亮〖11〗，不能承颜顺指；时或忤意，积以见责。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-ccce8d3f0a7a001adfaa","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-b129761fce3317a2290a","layer":"pei","quote":"恐群臣不从，乃大请会，赐将吏。问蕃：‘射不主皮，为力不同科，其义云何？’蕃思惟未答，即于殿上斩蕃","attribution":"裴注·《江表传》","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cde2697c79ac56416fb3","start":40,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-ccf1d82615dbb9718f39","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-d6be71290e551050ab3b","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：薛莹称“王蕃器量绰异〖1〗，弘博多通；楼玄清白节操，才理条畅；贺邵厉志高洁，机理清要〖2〗；韦曜笃学好古，博见群籍，有记述之才”。胡冲以为：“玄、邵、蕃一时清妙，略无优劣；必不得已，玄宜在先，邵当次之。华覈文赋之才〖3〗，有过于曜；而典诰不及也〖4〗。”予观覈数献良规，期于自尽〖5〗，庶几忠臣矣〖6〗！然此数子，处无妄之世而有名位〖7〗，强死其理〖8〗，得免为幸耳。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":499,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":187,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-d663be06ae8e54380fe2","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-cffc22fe3a057ac384ff","layer":"original","quote":"蕃沉醉顿伏〖12〗，皓疑而不悦，舆蕃出外〖13〗。顷之请还，酒亦不解；蕃性有威严，行止自若","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":17,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-e3f0ae338474432bfe7b","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-b129761fce3317a2290a","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《江表传》曰：“皓用巫史之言，谓‘建业宫不利’，乃西巡武昌，仍有迁都之意。恐群臣不从，乃大请会，赐将吏。问蕃：‘射不主皮，为力不同科，其义云何？’蕃思惟未答，即于殿上斩蕃。出登（来）〔袁〕山，使亲近将，跳蕃首，作虎跳狼争咋啮之，头皆碎坏；欲以示威，使众不敢犯也。”此与本传不同。","attribution":"裴注按语","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cde2697c79ac56416fb3","start":0,"end":142,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-f8499969f36a9bc0617d","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-8fe95262eaec65905a52","layer":"original","quote":"蕃体气高亮〖11〗，不能承颜顺指；时或忤意，积以见责","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":59,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-f8f44ded1581f439e9d8","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-542633ed464867e4cacb","layer":"original","quote":"王蕃字永元，庐江人也〖1〗。博览多闻。兼通术艺〖2〗。始为尚书郎〖3〗，去官。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-0afdb7821a1aca8855a0","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-d802ad7948c75961a8e4","layer":"original","quote":"永安初，从选曹郎为散骑中常侍","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-516a6deca6b34859bb81","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-97d739059bba97722b70","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《会稽典录》曰：“汜，字世洪。生南海，年十六，父卒，还乡里。孙綝废幼主，迎立琅邪王休。休未至，綝欲入宫，图为不轨；召百官会议，皆惶怖失色，徒唯唯而已。汜对曰：‘明公为国伊、周，处将相之位，擅废立之威；将上安宗庙，下惠百姓，大小踊跃，自以伊、霍复见。今迎王未至，而欲入宫；如是，群下摇荡，众听疑惑：非所以永终忠孝，扬名后世也。’綝不怿，竟立休。休初即位，汜与贺邵、王蕃、薛莹俱为散骑中常侍。以讨扶严功，拜交州刺史，冠军将军，余姚侯。寻卒。”","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2bf6738d5adf6a51cccd","start":0,"end":222,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-57f757984493adb40016","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-97d739059bba97722b70","layer":"pei","quote":"休初即位，汜与贺邵、王蕃、薛莹俱为散骑中常侍","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2bf6738d5adf6a51cccd","start":174,"end":196,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-3a72e0f14bf9e45791ea","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-606cc23ede6891780b6d","layer":"original","quote":"孙休即位，为散骑中常侍","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":44,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
